free-scp-no-volunteers-fax-content =
    ██████████████████████████████████████████
    INTERNAL FOUNDATION COMMUNICATION
    CLASSIFICATION: LEVEL 4 / OBJECT DIRECTOR EYES ONLY
    ██████████████████████████████████████████

    TO:       Object Facility Director, Foundation Complex \[REDACTED]
    FROM:     O5 Oversight — Containment Division
    SUBJECT:  Status of Anomalous Entities Containment — URGENT

    ──────────────────────────────────────────

    This message formally notifies the object command that, at the time of
    transfer, no confirmed active anomalous entities of any class were present in
    your complex.

    Foundation monitoring systems recorded no tracked anomalies present in
    designated containment areas. Comparing the data with recent breach reports,
    transfer logs, and neutralization records, we have reached the following
    assessment:

        • No Euclid-class entities were detected within containment parameters.
        • No Keter-class entities were detected within containment parameters.
        • No Safe-class objects requiring active oversight are present.

    ──────────────────────────────────────────

    ASSESSMENT:

    The cause of this absence has not yet been determined. Current investigative
    possibilities include, but are not limited to, the following:

        1. A coordinated containment breach followed by autonomous relocation.
        2. Unauthorized removal by infiltrating hostile personnel.
        3. Systemic containment failure resulting in neutralization.
        4. Errors in monitoring equipment operation — engineering inspection is
           recommended.

    ──────────────────────────────────────────

    DIRECTIVE:

    The Object Facility Director is instructed to immediately review all access logs,
    containment camera recordings, and personnel activity reports from the last 24
    hours. A full incident report must be forwarded to O5 Oversight within 6
    hours.

    High command is monitoring the situation. Further directives will follow upon
    receipt of your report.

    ██████████████████████████████████████████
    THIS MESSAGE WILL BE AUTO-DELETED IN 12 HOURS
    UNAUTHORIZED DISCLOSURE CONSTITUTES A LEVEL I VIOLATION
    ██████████████████████████████████████████
